<!--
  EXEMPLAR — the CLAUDE.md generated next to each module AGENTS.md. Written as the single
  line below, without this comment. It is what makes Claude Code load the module's AGENTS.md
  — on a Read, Edit or Write under the module, subagents included — since a module AGENTS.md
  alone is skipped while the root has a CLAUDE.md. Never add a fact here: the module's
  facts have one owner, its AGENTS.md. Design: decision 0139 of Nerviz.
-->
@AGENTS.md
